{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And you shall dwell in the land of Goshen</b> — Joseph knew about his father that he would not want to settle in the land of Egypt proper, where the capital of the kingdom was, therefore he sent him word already now that he would settle him in the land of Goshen. And the sense of \"you and your children\" is connected to the preceding verse: come down to me, you and your children and your children's children and your flocks and your herds and all that is yours."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:45:04.796595381Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}